The blocked sequential GDN kernel adapts the eight-lane state recurrence
from oMLX v0.6.1, omlx/custom_kernels/qwen35_prefill/gdn.py:
https://github.com/jundot/omlx

The upstream file is licensed under Apache-2.0. A copy of that license is
included in licenses/omlx-Apache-2.0.txt. The psi implementation adds F32
normalization and gates, model-derived geometry, ragged request metadata,
BF16 state arenas, arbitrary state snapshots, and per-token F32 replay logs.
